lor wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$1.14/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$14/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$17.5/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Oak_Tree\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041421\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Main Titles\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Main Titles.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Main_Titles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20250605041421\" /></a></span> Oak Tree</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Oak Tree</b> is a tree found in <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a> at the <i>Grasslands, Farlands,</i> and the <i>Savannah</i>. Other trees that can be found with this tree include <a href=\"/wiki/Spruce\" title=\"Spruce\">Spruce</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Birch\" title=\"Birch\">Birch</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Red_Maple\" title=\"Red Maple\">Red Maple</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">Acacia</a>. Its characteristics include a medium-brown bark, green leaves, and a beige wood. Like all trees, ores, and rocks, the Oak Tree can be used for filling <a href=\"/wiki/Schematics\" title=\"Schematics\">schematics</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Blueprint_Fabricator\" title=\"Blueprint Fabricator\">blueprints</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling_Price\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8e/Hexagon_Dollar.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616024527\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Dollar\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Dollar.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Dollar.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8e/Hexagon_Dollar.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250616024527\" /></a></span>Selling Price</span></h2>\n<p>The selling price of Oak trees (raw, sanded, and planked) can vary day to day. See the stock market located in the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a> to see the exact price of Oak on a particular day. The price listed on the wiki is the <u>default</u> price for selling raw or processed Oak.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Logged (Raw) - <span style=\"color:#2d9060;\">$1.14/stud</span>.</li>\n<li>Sanded - <span style=\"color:#2d9060;\">$14/stud</span>.</li>\n<li>Planked - <span style=\"color:#2d9060;\">$17.5/stud</span>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Foraging\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9b/Hexagon_Forage.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605035628\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Forage\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Forage.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Forage.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9b/Hexagon_Forage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250605035628\" /></a></span> Foraging</span></h2>\n<p>Oak Trees offer several forageable items, including the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Acorns (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWNvcm5zP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Acorns</span>, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, on Oak tree leaves.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Apple\" title=\"Apple\">Apples</a>, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, on Oak tree leaves.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Agaric Mushrooms (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQWdhcmljX011c2hyb29tcz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Agaric Mushrooms</span>, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, on Oak tree bark.</li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Daedalea Mushrooms (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGFlZGFsZWFfTXVzaHJvb21zP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Daedalea Mushrooms</span>, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, on Oak tree bark.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Beehive\" title=\"Beehive\">Beehives</a>, <span style=\"color:#acbacb;\">uncommon rarity</span>, on Oak tree leaves.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Golden_Apple\" title=\"Golden Apple\">Golden Apples</a>, <span style=\"color:#ffd454;\">rare rarity</span>, 1/1000 or 0.1% chance on Oak tree leaves.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Accessibility\">Accessibility</span></h2>\n<p>Certain trees require specific conditions to obtain them, whether it be a specific axe or a weather condition. Detailed spawn conditions and other concerns (such as the relative difficulty of farming this tree) are also listed in the following:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Oak is a <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span> tree.</li>\n<li>Can be logged using the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Axe\" title=\"Rusty Axe\">Rusty Axe</a> or higher.</li>\n<li>Can be sanded using the <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Sander\" title=\"Rusty Sander\">Rusty Sander</a> or higher.</li>\n<li>Can be planked using the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Planker\" title=\"Steel Planker\">Steel Planker</a> or higher.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Oak spawn conditions include the following:\n<ul><li>Oak trees must spawn on the surface.</li>\n<li>Oak trees must spawn on grass.</li>\n<li>Oak trees are localized to <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>, and the entrance to <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater\" title=\"Ferwater\">Ferwater</a>.</li>\n<li>An Oak tree forest called \"Mythril Forest\" spawns Oak trees in large clusters; it is located in Finlay.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2><p>\nThe various textures of the Oak Tree in its raw, sanded, and planked states.</p><div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"9f78881edab3d290d143462d0cbaa0a9\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Oak_Log_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:100px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Oak_Log_Texture.png\" title=\"Oak Log Texture.png (233 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:100px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/85/Oak_Log_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240312152908\" title=\"Oak Log Texture.png (233 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Oak Log Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Oak_Log_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Oak Log Texture.png (233 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Oak Log Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Oak_Log_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/85/Oak_Log_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240312152908\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:100px;\">Log</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Oak_Sanded_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:100px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Oak_Sanded_Texture.png\" title=\"Oak Sanded Texture.png (264 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:100px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Oak_Sanded_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240312152526\" title=\"Oak Sanded Texture.png (264 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Oak Sanded Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Oak_Sanded_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Oak Sanded Texture.png (264 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Oak Sanded Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Oak_Sanded_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/52/Oak_Sanded_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240312152526\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:100px;\">Sanded</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Oak_Planked_Texture-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:100px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Oak_Planked_Texture.png\" title=\"Oak Planked Texture.png (384 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:100px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ef/Oak_Planked_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240312152538\" title=\"Oak Planked Texture.png (384 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Oak Planked Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Oak_Planked_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Oak Planked Texture.png (384 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Oak Planked Texture.png\" data-image-key=\"Oak_Planked_Texture.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ef/Oak_Planked_Texture.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240312152538\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:100px;\">Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tree can be considered common due to the difficulty level of obtaining.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The Oak Tree was added during base game development.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>The Internal Name is called \"ExampleTree,\" as it most likely used as an example model for other trees. This can be seen if the <a href=\"/wiki/Statistic_Tool\" title=\"Statistic Tool\">Statistic Tool</a> is used on a schematic of Oak.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Oak (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6T2FrP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Oak\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Oak?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; font-size:95%; padding:0; text-align:left; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"background:#372A27; font-size:100%; border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; text-align:center\"><a 